---
// Why Stoke Van Locks — credibility section
---

<section id="why-us" class="bg-slate-50 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 sm:py-18 lg:py-20">

    <!-- Section heading -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3">
        Why Stoke Van Locks?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        We're not a national chain. We're a local specialist — and that makes all the difference
        when it comes to experience, advice, and the quality of work on your van.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">

      <!-- Card 1: Experience -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">Genuine Experience</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          15–18 years in the trade, hundreds (if not thousands) of installs. We've fitted locks
          on virtually every van make and model you can name — we know what works.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Quality Products -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">Quality Products</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We only fit products we trust. All locks come with a manufacturer's warranty —
          your peace of mind is backed by the product guarantee.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Professional Installation -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">Tidy, Professional Fit</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          A lock is only as good as its installation. We take pride in clean, precise fitting
          that looks right, operates smoothly, and lasts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Insurance / Local -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">Locally Based</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We're based in Stoke-on-Trent and know the area well. No call centres,
          no national markups — just a local tradesman you can speak to directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reassurance strip -->
    <div class="bg-navy-800 rounded-xl px-6 sm:px-8 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Warranty-backed products</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-0.5">All locks come with manufacturer warranty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <!-- TODO: Confirm insurance wording with client before launch -->
          <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Public liability insurance in place</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-0.5">Details available on request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Competitive, transparent pricing</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-0.5">No hidden extras. Free no-obligation quotes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
